  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "seat the players",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tokens",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_tokens"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "career_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_career_sum"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "discards",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "set the table",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_active_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_over",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[guard_rank] * guard_count + [priest_rank] * priest_count + [baron_rank] * baron_count + [handmaid_rank] * handmaid_count + [prince_rank] * prince_count + [king_rank] * king_count + [countess_rank] * countess_count + [princess_rank] * princess_count"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "round begins",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "token_awarded",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "new hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_over == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[guard_rank] * guard_count + [priest_rank] * priest_count + [baron_rank] * baron_count + [handmaid_rank] * handmaid_count + [prince_rank] * prince_count + [king_rank] * king_count + [countess_rank] * countess_count + [princess_rank] * princess_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "discards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "discard_sum",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": "all",
            "to": "playing"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "burned_card",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "burned_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck_count_after_deal"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_over",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "A new hand is dealt. One card is burned face down, five are laid face up, and each player gets one card."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "face-up cards",
      "when": {
        "calc": "new_hand == 1"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "The face-up out-of-play cards are ranks {face_up}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "start turn",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opp_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "kept",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].hand[0] if len(players[active_seat - 1].hand) > 0 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(deck) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(deck) > 0"
            },
            "announce_to": {
              "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
            },
            "text": "You kept rank {kept} and just drew rank {pick}."
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(deck) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
            },
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[countess_rank] if (countess_rank in you.hand and (prince_rank in you.hand or king_rank in you.hand)) else ([you.hand[0]] if (len(you.hand) < 2 or you.hand[0] == you.hand[1]) else sorted(you.hand))"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "choose discard",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "dc"
      },
      "text": "Choose which rank from your hand to discard and play. The other card stays in your hand."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "store choice and countess",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard_choice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int($dc)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard_choice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "countess_rank"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "countess_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand and (prince_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand or king_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "discard",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_name",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['', 'Guard', 'Priest', 'Baron', 'Handmaid', 'Prince', 'King', 'Countess', 'Princess'][discard_choice]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard_choice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "discards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard_choice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "discard_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard_choice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "career_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard_choice"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} discards rank {discard_choice} ({card_name})."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "guard guess",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == guard_rank"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "guard_guess_min"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "guard_guess_max"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "g"
      },
      "text": "You played a Guard. Name a rank from {guard_guess_min} to {guard_guess_max}. If your opponent is unprotected and holds that rank, they are out of the hand."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "guard resolve",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == guard_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "guess",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int($g)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "guard blocked",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {opp_seat} is protected by a Handmaid: the Guard has no effect."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and len(players[opp_seat - 1].hand) > 0 and players[opp_seat - 1].hand[0] == guess"
            },
            "text": "Hit! Seat {player} holds rank {guess} and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].eliminated == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "guard miss",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and players[opp_seat - 1].eliminated == 0"
            },
            "text": "Miss: Seat {opp_seat} does not hold rank {guess}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "priest",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == priest_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "priest blocked",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {opp_seat} is protected by a Handmaid: the Priest has no effect."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "peek",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].hand[0] if len(players[opp_seat - 1].hand) > 0 else 0"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0"
            },
            "announce_to": {
              "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
            },
            "text": "Seat {opp_seat}'s card is rank {peek}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "priest look",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0"
            },
            "text": "Seat {active_seat} looked at Seat {opp_seat}'s card."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "baron",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == baron_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "baron blocked",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {opp_seat} is protected by a Handmaid: the Baron has no effect."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "low_rank",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(players[0].hand[0], players[1].hand[0])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and len(players[0].hand) > 0 and len(players[1].hand) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and players[active_seat - 1].hand[0] < players[opp_seat - 1].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Baron: Seat {player} holds the lower card, rank {low_rank}, and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and players[opp_seat - 1].hand[0] < players[active_seat - 1].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Baron: Seat {player} holds the lower card, rank {low_rank}, and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.eliminated == 1"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "baron tie",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0 and players[opp_seat - 1].hand[0] == players[active_seat - 1].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Baron: the cards are equal. It is a tie and nobody is out."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "handmaid",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == handmaid_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} is protected by the Handmaid until their next turn starts."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "prince",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == prince_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "active_seat if players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 1 else opp_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[target_seat - 1].hand[0] if len(players[target_seat - 1].hand) > 0 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "discards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "discard_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "career_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "text": "Prince: Seat {player} discards rank {pick}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick == princess_rank"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} discarded the Princess and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick == princess_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "from_deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "0 if pick == princess_rank else (1 if len(deck) > 0 else (2 if len(burned_card) > 0 else 0))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "drawn",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "from_deck == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "drawn",
            "value": {
              "calc": "burned_card[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "from_deck == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "target_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drawn"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "from_deck > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drawn"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "from_deck == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {target_seat} draws a new card from the deck."
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "burned_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drawn"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "from_deck == 2"
            },
            "text": "The deck is empty: Seat {target_seat} takes the burned card."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "king",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == king_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "note",
            "value": "king blocked",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 1"
            },
            "text": "Seat {opp_seat} is protected by a Handmaid: the King has no effect."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "swap_tmp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].hand"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].hand"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "swap_tmp"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[opp_seat - 1].protected == 0"
            },
            "text": "King: Seat {active_seat} and Seat {opp_seat} swap hand cards."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "princess",
      "when": {
        "calc": "discard_choice == princess_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} discarded the Princess and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "showdown",
      "when": {
        "calc": "sum([p.eliminated for p in players]) == 0 and (deck_count == 0 or round_number == total_rounds)"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "show1",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].hand[0] if len(players[0].hand) > 0 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "show2",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].hand[0] if len(players[1].hand) > 0 else 0"
            },
            "text": "Showdown: Seat 1 holds rank {show1}, Seat 2 holds rank {show2}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "show1 < show2 or (show1 == show2 and players[0].discard_sum < players[1].discard_sum)"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} loses the showdown and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "show2 < show1 or (show1 == show2 and players[1].discard_sum < players[0].discard_sum)"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} loses the showdown and is out of the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.eliminated == 1"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "show1 == show2 and players[0].discard_sum == players[1].discard_sum"
            },
            "text": "The hand is tied: equal cards and equal discard sums. No token is awarded."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "award",
      "when": {
        "calc": "sum([p.eliminated for p in players]) == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.seat for p in players if p.eliminated == 0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "tokens",
            "value": {
              "calc": "tokens_per_hand_won"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_tokens",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[winner_seat - 1].tokens"
            },
            "text": "Seat {winner_seat} wins the hand and now has {winner_tokens} tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_over",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "token_awarded",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.seat for p in players if p.eliminated == 1])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "token_awarded == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} takes the next turn."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "end check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.tokens * 1000 + you.career_sum",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Tokens: Seat 1 {players[0].tokens}, Seat 2 {players[1].tokens}; career sums: Seat 1 {players[0].career_sum}, Seat 2 {players[1].career_sum}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "A two-player Love Letter duel lasting exactly {total_rounds} rounds; each round is one turn of the active player (Seat {starting_active_seat} goes first).\n\nCARDS ({deck_size}): rank {guard_rank} Guard x{guard_count}, rank {priest_rank} Priest x{priest_count}, rank {baron_rank} Baron x{baron_count}, rank {handmaid_rank} Handmaid x{handmaid_count}, rank {prince_rank} Prince x{prince_count}, rank {king_rank} King x{king_count}, rank {countess_rank} Countess x{countess_count}, rank {princess_rank} Princess x{princess_count}. Your hand is seen only by you; discards are public; deck order and the burned card are hidden.\n\nNEW HAND (whenever the previous hand is over, and at the start): all cards return to the deck and it is shuffled. {burned_cards} card is burned face down and {face_up_out_of_play} are laid face up (announced); each player is dealt {cards_dealt_per_player} card, leaving {deck_count_after_deal} in the deck. Protection, eliminations and each hand's discard sum reset to 0.\n\nYOUR TURN: your Handmaid protection ends. You draw the top card (you are told the rank you kept and the rank you drew), then choose one of your two ranks to discard; its rank is added to your discard sum and career sum and announced. If you hold the Countess together with the Prince or King, you must discard the Countess (it is the only option). Then its effect:\n- Guard: name a rank from {guard_guess_min} to {guard_guess_max}. If the opponent is protected, no effect. If their card is that rank, they are out of the hand (hit); otherwise nothing happens (miss).\n- Priest: if the opponent is unprotected, you privately see their card and everyone is told you looked; if protected, no effect.\n- Baron: if the opponent is unprotected, compare hand cards; the lower card's owner is out and the losing rank is announced; on equal cards it is a tie and nobody is out. If protected, no effect.\n- Handmaid: you are protected until your next turn starts.\n- Prince: the target is your opponent, or yourself if the opponent is protected. The target discards their card (rank added to their discard sum and career sum, and announced). If it was the Princess, the target is out. Otherwise the target draws the top deck card, or the burned card if the deck is empty.\n- King: if the opponent is unprotected, you swap hand cards (announced); if protected, no effect.\n- Countess: no effect.\n- Princess: discarding it puts you out of the hand.\n\nSHOWDOWN: if nobody is out and the deck is empty (or it is round {total_rounds}), both hands are revealed; the lower card's owner is out. On equal cards, the lower discard sum is out. If those are also equal, the hand is tied: no token, and a new hand is dealt.\n\nAWARD: when exactly one player is out, the other gains {tokens_per_hand_won} token, the hand is over, and the player who was out takes the first turn of the next hand. If no token was awarded, the turn passes to the other seat.\n\nEND: after round {total_rounds}, more tokens wins; if tied, the higher career sum (all ranks discarded over the whole game, including Prince-forced discards) wins; if both are equal, the players share the win as a draw."
}
